Actually thinking a bit more about this error message:

>> >> libtool: link: `/usr/lib/libuuid.la <http://libuuid.la>' is not a valid libtool archive

three reasons come to mind that would make that file invalid:

1. A bad hard drive
2. the wrong architecture
3. misconfigured system

Maybe those can give you some clues?

Best,

Jeff

