> I've had the same problem a few times. It happens when your R tmp dir is not
> writable, which again might happen if you are on a shared VPS. Try changing
> R's temp dir:
>

> *mkdir /Rtmp
> chmod +t,ugo+rwx /Rtmp*
> *export TMP=/Rtmp*
> *
> *

> Now everything should work fine.

